			"notes": "_**Halal Minecraft?!?!?!??!** NoPorkChops is a very basic mod that applies all current negative effects to you with maximum amplifiers after eating a porkchop._\n\n## This is the 2.0.0 version, the first major update and remaster of the NoPorkChops mod!  \nThis is a complete refresh of the mod, and the one that actually works!\n### Changelog:\n- Considered best practices and proper disposal in code.\n- Used modern Fabric templates instead of old tutorial-hell directory trees.\n- **Removed unnecessary dependencies and useless Mod Menu settings.**\n- Removed unused files and cache.\n- Now uses more low-level and cleaner mixin injection onto the bytecode instead of using the Fabric API.\n- **Now uses the MPL-2.0 license instead of the older and more restrictive GPL-v3.0!**\n- Improved formatting and README.md.\n- Packed with more experience than ever and more!\n\n**_Choose the correct file for your Minecraft minor version series accordingly._**"
